{"4267080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sunny Side Up", "steam_appid": 4267080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A <u>cozy parkour adventure game</u> about a small egg on a big journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sunny Side Up, you guide a small but brave egg across a charming farm filled with unique handmade levels, playful obstacles, hidden paths, and vertical challenges. Hop, climb, and bounce your way through each level as you slowly make your way back to where you belong. It starts simple, but each level adds something new to figure out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267080/extras/b11e508a0d8a10a5c27dd92d88434bed.avif?t=1784911523\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267080/extras_big/b11e508a0d8a10a5c27dd92d88434bed.webp?t=1784911523 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Your Parkour Game Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use simple, satisfying movement to get past obstacles and reach new heights. Every jump is meant to feel good and easy to learn, but still takes a bit of practice to really get right. Mess up, try again, and keep moving forward!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Charming Farm That Was Handcrafted w/ LOVE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a colorful farm full of cozy spots, hidden routes, and small details to notice along the way. Some paths are obvious; others you’ll have to look a little closer to find. Take your time or keep pushing forward; it’s up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267080/extras/ac863a24a074ea308ecb848068972d33.avif?t=1784911523\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267080/extras_big/ac863a24a074ea308ecb848068972d33.avif?t=1784911523 width=1560 height=1422 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Climb Toward Home</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work your way through a set of unique levels as you keep <strong>climbing higher</strong> and <u>getting closer to your family</u>. The path isn’t always clear, and some jumps can be tricky, but every bit of progress counts. You might even start to piece together where you came from along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Wholesome, Relaxing Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a lighthearted adventure focused on atmosphere, charm, and steady progress. You can take it slow or try to improve your runs as you go. It’s meant to be relaxing, a little challenging at times, and easy to come back to whenever you feel like playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267080/extras/181489b62e8d86dde08374de091d56a5.avif?t=1784911523\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267080/extras_big/181489b62e8d86dde08374de091d56a5.webp?t=1784911523 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A <u>cozy parkour adventure game</u> about a small egg on a big journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sunny Side Up, you guide a small but brave egg across a charming farm filled with unique handmade levels, playful obstacles, hidden paths, and vertical challenges. Hop, climb, and bounce your way through each level as you slowly make your way back to where you belong. It starts simple, but each level adds something new to figure out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267080/extras/b11e508a0d8a10a5c27dd92d88434bed.avif?t=1784911523\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267080/extras_big/b11e508a0d8a10a5c27dd92d88434bed.webp?t=1784911523 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Your Parkour Game Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use simple, satisfying movement to get past obstacles and reach new heights. Every jump is meant to feel good and easy to learn, but still takes a bit of practice to really get right. Mess up, try again, and keep moving forward!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Charming Farm That Was Handcrafted w/ LOVE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a colorful farm full of cozy spots, hidden routes, and small details to notice along the way. Some paths are obvious; others you’ll have to look a little closer to find. Take your time or keep pushing forward; it’s up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267080/extras/ac863a24a074ea308ecb848068972d33.avif?t=1784911523\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267080/extras_big/ac863a24a074ea308ecb848068972d33.avif?t=1784911523 width=1560 height=1422 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Climb Toward Home</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work your way through a set of unique levels as you keep <strong>climbing higher</strong> and <u>getting closer to your family</u>. The path isn’t always clear, and some jumps can be tricky, but every bit of progress counts. You might even start to piece together where you came from along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Wholesome, Relaxing Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a lighthearted adventure focused on atmosphere, charm, and steady progress. You can take it slow or try to improve your runs as you go. It’s meant to be relaxing, a little challenging at times, and easy to come back to whenever you feel like playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267080/extras/181489b62e8d86dde08374de091d56a5.avif?t=1784911523\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267080/extras_big/181489b62e8d86dde08374de091d56a5.webp?t=1784911523 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Sunny Side Up is a cozy 3D parkour adventure game where you guide a brave little egg across a charming farm to reunite w/ your family. Master playful jumps, uncover hidden paths, &amp; explore handcrafted levels on a heartfelt journey full of charm, one careful hop at a time. Can you find your way home?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267080/13fcc2cd297d0be6db6187c8841c3afb46b178f1/header.jpg?t=1784911523", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267080/25d2864888e0e1e1e09f3c6c11b10ebcba950052/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784911523", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267080/25d2864888e0e1e1e09f3c6c11b10ebcba950052/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784911523", "website": "https://playsunnysideup.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit (Version 20H2)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 7600 or Ryzen 3 1300X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 or AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 700 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit (Version 23H2)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 11600 or Ryzen 5 5600<br></li><li